 1| //! OpenCompany Rust core.
 2| //!
 3| //! This crate is intentionally shaped as a light host around OpenHuman and the
 4| //! TinyHumans Rust modules. The default build stays small; enable the `tiny`
 5| //! feature to compile against the sibling `tiny*` crates.
 6| 
 7| pub mod analytics;
 8| pub mod app;
